PROJECT: 2D PUZZLE ADVENTURE — ANDROID STUDIO + JAVA

1. Your Role

Act as a senior Android game developer and software architect. Build a complete, playable 2D puzzle-adventure game using Android Studio, Java, and the native Android SDK.

Do not use Godot, Unity, Flutter, React Native, or Kotlin. Use Java for all application and game logic.

The game is inspired by the feeling of a friendly, gadget-filled cartoon adventure, with original characters and assets unless the developer has secured the necessary licenses.

Do not merely provide explanations or pseudocode. Create the actual project files, implement the gameplay, configure the project, and provide instructions to build and run the game.

